{
  "page": 530,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4874,
      "text": "Dan beritahukanlah kepada mereka bahwa air itu dibagi di antara mereka (dengan unta betina itu); setiap orang berhak mendapat giliran minum.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4875,
      "text": "Maka mereka memanggil kawannya, lalu dia menangkap (unta itu) dan memotongnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4876,
      "text": "Maka betapa dahsyatnya azab-Ku dan peringatan-Ku!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4877,
      "text": "Kami kirimkan atas mereka satu suara yang keras mengguntur, maka jadilah mereka seperti batang-batang kering yang lapuk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4878,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, telah Kami mudahkan Al-Qur`an untuk peringatan, maka adakah orang yang mau mengambil pelajaran?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4879,
      "text": "Kaum Luṭ pun telah mendustakan peringatan itu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4880,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami kirimkan kepada mereka badai yang membawa batu-batu (yang menimpa mereka), kecuali keluarga Luṭ. Kami selamatkan mereka sebelum fajar menyingsing,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4881,
      "text": "sebagai nikmat dari Kami. Demikianlah Kami memberi balasan kepada orang-orang yang bersyukur.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4882,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, dia (Luṭ) telah memperingatkan mereka akan hukuman Kami, tetapi mereka mendustakan peringatan-Ku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4883,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, mereka telah membujuknya (agar menyerahkan) tamunya (kepada mereka), lalu Kami butakan mata mereka, maka rasakanlah azab-Ku dan peringatan-Ku!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4884,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, pada esok harinya mereka benar-benar ditimpa azab yang tetap.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4885,
      "text": "Maka rasakanlah azab-Ku dan peringatan-Ku!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4886,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, telah Kami mudahkan Al-Qur`an untuk peringatan, maka adakah orang yang mau mengambil pelajaran?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4887,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, peringatan telah datang kepada keluarga Fir'aun.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4888,
      "text": "Mereka mendustakan mukjizat-mukjizat Kami semuanya, maka Kami azab mereka dengan azab dari Żat Yang Mahaperkasa, Mahakuasa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4889,
      "text": "Apakah orang-orang kafir di lingkunganmu (kaum musyrikin) lebih baik dari mereka, ataukah kamu telah mempunyai jaminan kebebasan (dari azab) dalam kitab-kitab terdahulu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4890,
      "text": "Atau mereka mengatakan, \"Kami ini golongan yang bersatu yang pasti menang.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4891,
      "text": "Golongan itu pasti akan dikalahkan dan mereka akan mundur ke belakang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4892,
      "text": "Bahkan hari Kiamat itulah hari yang dijanjikan kepada mereka dan hari Kiamat itu lebih dahsyat dan lebih pahit.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4893,
      "text": "Sungguh, orang-orang yang berdosa berada dalam kesesatan (di dunia) dan akan berada dalam neraka (di akhirat).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4894,
      "text": "Pada hari mereka diseret ke neraka pada wajahnya. (Dikatakan kepada mereka), \"Rasakanlah sentuhan api neraka.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4895,
      "text": "Sungguh, Kami menciptakan segala sesuatu menurut ukuran.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
